{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Star Mountain</strong> is a fast paced pvp platformer for up to <strong>4 players</strong>  where you must race to get a star before your opponent. Build your own platforms, and block your opponent to get to the star first! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Freeze Yourself to Reach New Heights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core mechanic of <strong>Star Mountain</strong> is the ability to build your own platforms, using you and your opponents characters to reach the star. By frequently <strong>freezing</strong> your character, you can be <strong>offensive</strong> to create your own path to victory, or <strong>defensive</strong> to block in your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.poster.avif?t=1768540383\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.webm?t=1768540383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938920/extras/b1fb2476af9091fd82792480b0a44da7.mp4?t=1768540383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online and Local Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends are across the world? Got no friends? No matter! <strong>Star mountain</strong> features <strong>online multiplayer</strong> so you can play with amazing strangers and maybe meet your new best friend! Or, if you're lucky and have friends, there is also <strong>local multiplayer</strong>! (With split keyboard and controller compatibility) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As featured in Wonderville arcade in New York City!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From March 1st - June 1st 2024, 